"You and your partner decide to get married! How big will the wedding be?": "¡Tú y tu pareja deciden casarse! ¿Qué tan grande será la boda?", "Big wedding ($28,000)": "Boda grande ($28,000)", "Big wedding": "Boda grande", "Beautiful day. The average U.S. wedding costs about $30,000, and many couples start married life in debt. Combining incomes now helps a lot.": "Un día hermoso. La boda promedio en EE. UU. cuesta unos $30,000 y muchas parejas empiezan endeudadas. Juntar ingresos ahora ayuda mucho.",
