"Your family depends on your income. An agent offers": "Tu familia depende de tu ingreso. Un agente ofrece", "term life insurance": "seguro de vida a plazo", ": $500,000 of coverage for": ": $500,000 de cobertura por", "$35 a month": "$35 al mes", "Buy it": "Comprarlo", "Term life is cheap when you’re young and healthy. If something happened to you, your family could pay the bills and the home.": "El seguro de vida a plazo es barato cuando eres joven y sano. Si te pasara algo, tu familia podría pagar las cuentas y la casa.", "You save $35 a month. Experts suggest life insurance worth about 10 times your income once others depend on you.": "Ahorras $35 al mes. Los expertos sugieren un seguro de vida de unas 10 veces tu ingreso cuando otros dependen de ti.",
